    <string name="settings_power_options_hide_when_locked">鎖定時隱藏電源相關選項</string>
    <string name="settings_power_options_hide_when_locked_desc">鎖定時隱藏關機、重啟、重啟至 Recovery 及重啟至 Bootloader 選項。\n<b>注意：這並非防盜功能，小偷仍可長按電源鍵 10 秒或拔出 SIM 卡！</b></string>
    <string name="settings_power_options_open_collapsed">開啟時收合</string>
    <string name="settings_power_options_open_collapsed_desc">開啟 Classic Power Menu 時，如果電源選項超過一列，預設先收合電源選項面板</string>
